  + request and response claims explicitly deny persistence authentication provider execution and external effects
  + dispatch validates registry request expected root operation-specific input exclusivity exact custody resolution and final response
  + expose one bounded stdin-to-stdout CLI command using the canonical scripted in-memory registry and no file write

& [Acceptance]
  + every operation produces a strict deterministic response and repeated calls are byte-identical
  + inspect output omits complete checkpoint request response message and transport bodies
  + resolve returns the exact retained checkpoint and is explicitly marked host-facing
  + both resume operations equal their direct Slice7B resume functions
  + wrong root wrong operation-input pairing wrong position cross-kind use request mutation response mutation unknown fields and trailing stdin bytes fail closed
  + CLI accepts one bounded strict JSON request on stdin emits one strict JSON response on stdout and rejects missing oversized invalid or extra arguments before effects

& [IdentityBoundary]
